            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Age 25:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kolosenenete Daudi ka iketuŋa kosuronokis Igesurin, ka Igirisin, ka Imalekain: naarai atekerin nun eboienenete apeŋo kakwap kiton Sur, kiton akwap nako Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodany Daudi ituŋa, mam abu kitajar etuŋanan arai aberu, konata amerekekin ka imoŋin, asigiria ka akaalai, ka igoen; kobono, kobu neejai Akis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.141.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sab 141:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Awa 29:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Siit 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Akis atiar, “Ai bo lolo ipotu kosurokis?” Kotema Daudi atiar, “Eŋalakimak naka Yuda,” ka “Eŋalakimak naka Iyerameelin,” ka “Eŋalakimak naka Ikenin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam Daudi abu kitajar etuŋanan karaida aberu, ayaŋaun kes Gat, kobala ebe, “Kinyeis einer ebe, ‘Eswama Daudi kwanata.’’’ Ido eswamaenenei ŋesi kwaŋin apak kere naeboienonoo kakwap naka Ipilisitian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyu Akis Daudi, kobala ebe, “Ainaki iketuŋa Isirael aila ŋes eut; kanuka ŋun eraun ekakejaanakinan ikar kere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
